name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q5_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'A student tests an AI chatbot by asking it the same question five times. They get three different answers. What should the student conclude?'

wrong 'The AI is broken and should not be used for any purpose.'
wrong 'The first answer is always the most accurate because the AI hadn\'t been confused yet.'
right 'The AI\'s outputs are not fully reliable for this question, and the student should verify the information using other sources before relying on any single response.'
wrong 'The most common answer among the five is guaranteed to be correct.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

